  "prefLabel": "Env-Dw 721.02 Exemptions",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-Dw 721.02 Exemptions. The department shall issue exemptions from the requirements of these drinking water rules as specified in 40 CFR 142 Subparts C and F, as applicable.\n\nSource. #10617, eff 6-1-14",
